<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOCCER-AFRICAN CLUB COMPETITION RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AFRICAN CLUB COMPETITION RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of second round,</p>
<p>second leg matches in African club soccer competitions:</p>
<p>Played Saturday:</p>
<p>Ccnfederation of African Football (CAF) Cup</p>
<p>In Tunis: Esperance ST (Tunisia) 4 USFA (Burkina Faso) 1</p>
<p>(halftime 3-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Esperance ST - Ayadi Hamrouni 10 pen, Mourad Chebbi 32,</p>
<p>Khaled Badra 43, Mohamed Badraoui 62</p>
<p>USFA - Zaidi Compaore 44 pen</p>
<p>Attendance: 15,000</p>
<p>Experance ST win 5-2 on aggregate</p>
<p>Cup Winners' Cup</p>
<p>In Sousse: L'Etoile Sportive du Sahel (Tunisia) 4 Hearts of</p>
<p>Oak (Ghana) 1 (1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>L'Etoile Sportive - Kais Ghodbane 34, Ferid Chouchaine 53,</p>
<p>Zoubeir Beya 81, Riadh Jlassi 82.</p>
<p>Hearts of Oak - Avoiko Williams 80</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
<p>L'Etoile Sportive win 6-3 on aggregate</p>
</text>
